{"t":"SKYD","made":"2026-11-13 00:57","name":"Skydance Corporation","ko":null,"sector":"Communication Services","industry":"Entertainment","employees":17600,"hq":"New York, NY, United States","website":"https://www.skydance.com","summary_en":"Skydance Corporation operates as a media and entertainment company worldwide. It operates in three segments: Studios, Direct-to-Consumer, and TV Media. The company operates CBS Television Network, a domestic broadcast television network; CBS Stations, a television station; international free-to-air networks comprising Network 10, Channel 5, Telefe, and Chilevisión; and domestic premium and basic cable networks, such as Nickelodeon, MTV, CMT, Comedy Central, BET, Paramount+ with SHOWTIME, Paramount Network, The Smithsonian Channel, BET Media Group, CBS Sports Network, and international extensions of these brands. It also provides domestic and international television studio operations, including CBS Studios, Paramount Television Studios, and Showtime; CBS Media Ventures, which produces and distributes first-run syndicated programming; and digital properties consist of CBS News and CBS Sports HQ. In addition, the company offers a portfolio of domestic and international pay and free streaming services, including Paramount+, Pluto TV, and BET+. Further, it produces and acquires films, series, and short-form content for release and licensing worldwide, including in theaters, on streaming services, on television, through home entertainment, and DVDs, Blu-ray; and operates a portfolio consisting of Paramount Pictures, Paramount Players, Paramount Animation, Nickelodeon Studio, and Miramax. It provides production, distribution, and advertising solutions. The company was formerly known as Paramount Skydance Corporation and changed its name to Skydance Corporation in October 2026. The company was founded in 1914 and is headquartered in New York, New York.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Skydance Corporation은 전 세계적으로 미디어 및 엔터테인먼트 회사로 운영되고 있습니다. 스튜디오, 소비자 직접 판매, TV 미디어의 세 가지 부문으로 운영됩니다. 회사는 국내 방송 TV 네트워크인 CBS Television Network를 운영합니다. 텔레비전 방송국인 CBS Stations; Network 10, Channel 5, Telefe 및 Chilevisión으로 구성된 국제 무료 방송 네트워크; Nickelodeon, MTV, CMT, Comedy Central, BET, SHOWTIME이 포함된 Paramount+, Paramount Network, The Smithsonian Channel, BET Media Group, CBS Sports Network 및 이러한 브랜드의 국제 확장과 같은 국내 프리미엄 및 기본 케이블 네트워크. 또한 CBS Studios, Paramount Television Studios 및 Showtime을 포함한 국내 및 국제 TV 스튜디오 운영을 제공합니다. 첫 번째 신디케이트 프로그램을 제작 및 배포하는 CBS Media Ventures; 디지털 자산은 CBS 뉴스와 CBS 스포츠 HQ로 구성됩니다. 또한 Paramount+, Pluto TV, BET+ 등 국내외 유료 및 무료 스트리밍 서비스 포트폴리오를 제공합니다. 또한 극장, 스트리밍 서비스, 텔레비전, 홈 엔터테인먼트, DVD, 블루레이 등을 포함하여 전 세계적으로 출시 및 라이센스를 위한 영화, 시리즈 및 단편 콘텐츠를 제작하고 획득합니다. 파라마운트 픽처스, 파라마운트 플레이어스, 파라마운트 애니메이션, 니켈로디언 스튜디오, 미라맥스로 구성된 포트폴리오를 운영하고 있습니다. 제작, 유통, 광고 솔루션을 제공합니다. 이 회사는 이전에 Paramount Skydance Corporation으로 알려졌으며 2026년 10월에 Skydance Corporation으로 이름을 변경했습니다. 이 회사는 1914년에 설립되었으며 뉴욕주 뉴욕에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":7.705,"mcap":38865735680.0,"pe":null,"fpe":-57.13756,"peg":2.5869,"ps":1.3351336,"pb":0.7301241,"ev_ebitda":7.666,"div":2.3,"beta":1.644,"hi52":16.31,"lo52":6.61},"fin":{"rev":29109999616.0,"rev_g":0.009,"eps_g":-0.541,"gross":0.33328998,"op":0.09345,"net":-0.021329999,"roe":-0.00896,"fcf":17593124864.0,"cash":1627000064.0,"debt":16202000384.0,"de":126.479,"eps":-0.02,"feps":-0.13485},"own":{"short":0.0327,"inst":0.32898,"insider":0.50941},"analyst":{"n":18,"mean":9.06333,"median":9.0,"high":13.74,"low":4.2,"rec":"hold","recMean":3.16667,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":3,"buy":3,"hold":10,"sell":5,"strongSell":3},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":3,"buy":3,"hold":10,"sell":5,"strongSell":3},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":3,"buy":1,"hold":9,"sell":6,"strongSell":3},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":2,"buy":1,"hold":10,"sell":6,"strongSell":2}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-10","Firm":"Wells Fargo","ToGrade":"Underweight","FromGrade":"Underweight","Action":"main","priceTarget